				{ "speaker": "Col. Gregor Strel (secure line)", "color": [0.75, 0.75, 0.8], "text": "And if they do not, Premier?" },
				{ "speaker": "Premier Dmitri Vasko (secure line)", "color": [0.85, 0.2, 0.2], "text": "Then we turn it on Volgrad and show the world the Concord's cruelty. A city is a small price for a continent." },
